      "role": "user",
      "content": "i keep thinking about how everything is just entropy. like, if the universe is eventually going to be cold and dead anyway, then any effort to stay alive or build anything is just fighting a losing battle. it feels like we're just delaying the inevitable for no actual reason. doesn't it seem kind of pointless to keep struggling when the end result is always zero?",
